Here's the Python code:

```python
import re

def generate_assert_statements(code):
    assert_statements = re.findall(r'Debug\.Assert\(.*\);', code)
    return assert_statements

code = '''
// Some C# code
Debug.Assert(true == false, "This will fail");
'''

print(generate_assert_statements(code))
```

